{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Make close gating atomic with failure selection.** `close()` can set `closing` after this check but before `signalContinuationFailure`, causing an ordinary shutdown race to select retry control and stop unrelated operations. Check `closing` and complete the manager failure under the same `activeThreads` synchronization, applying the same fix to the worker-failure path below, then add a barrier-based race test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc773rZP","finding_digest":"01549e6d2143e64fefe3915cbdad512a04d09b2f3512d27c5e2532fadf9afa04","finding_id":"arf_v1_afkj43jbipte737dsfol3lkrfi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::signalcontinuationfailure::close-admission-race","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::signalcontinuationfailure::close-admission-race","line":589,"observation_digest":"a249ba21c5ba7c65efeca8e7d91dd2015af333de46e6d8d0adc1c61d5e7038f2","observation_id":"aro_v1_uje3uiofxj6gl37mvdt5shosaf","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_afkj43jbipte737dsfol3lkrfi","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:06:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vt34dnzhr72mh75qityehqrhqi","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"a43deba101516dc5a2fb5f51733728623cc57e1a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":587,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_ac4vhpq4svem5m2ujzrgnhnsx3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:06:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
